messages ({(["poster":"Judy","time":803483819,"body":"any one plx tell me how many riding skills can mount 陸行鳥??plx...and 陸行鳥通常在哪出現??plx tell me...thx","title":"< no title >","id":477,]),(["poster":"Het","time":803642209,"title":"< no title >","body":"  真奇怪!!為何我東方大陸的探險度都停在 16.6% 呢??我已經走了好幾天了!!是不是有問題啊  ??","id":478,]),(["poster":"Dii","time":803721184,"body":"On Sun Jun 18, Karrimor wrote:> On Sat Jun 17, Mike wrote:> > 拜託....還鐵點剛槍是啥武器啊?!> > skill 80 neh...> > 爛的跟啥一樣...> > 怎麼差那麼多.....我用起來覺好好說> 我的騎士用渾鐵點鋼槍去打牛頭人只要一顆小還丹...> 掃光迷宮裡的惡魔戰士4個及席理斯只要一個天香斷續膏> 好好用耶....> -Karrimor^^^^^^^^^^^^^             你是 int 二十的聰明騎士啊.............             當然不一樣羅..","title":"Re: Re: < no title >","id":479,]),(["poster":"Angel","time":803782934,"body":"On Tue Jun 20, Het wrote:>   真奇怪!!為何我東方大陸的探險度都停在 16.6% 呢??> 我已經走了好幾天了!!是不是有問題啊  ??=================================================eastland explore is hard to gain la!!!how about try kill some mobs, solve quests, and goto some special place!!!eastland explore is not easy to gain as in noden la! ccc ","title":"Re: < no title >","id":480,]),(["poster":"Ishige","time":803814004,"title":"< no title >","body":"To all:	有鑑於最近公會儲藏室內東西太多...	所以把儲藏室改回原來的模式.....	等我想到解決的方法時候再說吧.....				ishige","id":481,]),(["poster":"Dii","time":803815999,"title":"Re: Re: < no title >","body":"On Thu Jun 22, Angel wrote:> On Tue Jun 20, Het wrote:> >   真奇怪!!為何我東方大陸的探險度都停在 16.6% 呢??> > 我已經走了好幾天了!!是不是有問題啊  ??> =================================================> eastland explore is hard to gain la!!!> > how about try kill some mobs, solve quests, and goto some special place!!!> > eastland explore is not easy to gain as in noden la! ccc       wa....angel...neh...好久沒看到了","id":482,]),(["poster":"Lucifer","time":803830382,"body":"On Thu Jun 22, Ishige wrote:> To all:> 	有鑑於最近公會儲藏室內東西太多...> 	所以把儲藏室改回原來的模式.....> 	等我想到解決的方法時候再說吧.....> > 				ishige>    太多??no see any eqs...          lucifer ","title":"Re: < no title >","id":483,]),